  "dct_title_s": "Active Planning Zones: San Mateo County, California, 2014",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This polygon shapefile depicts land areas, or zones, for which planning is actively taking place as of November 18, 2014. Zones can also dictate permitted uses and restrictions for any new development in these areas, such as height, density and purpose of structures. This layer is part of a collection of GIS data for San Mateo County, California.",
    "This coverage can be used for basic applications such as viewing, querying, and map output production, or to provide a basemap to support graphical overlays and analyses of geospatial data."
